he following.", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[325, 1056], [667, 1060], [666, 1096], [325, 1092]]}, {"text": "a) If a : b = 4 : 5 and b : c = 5 : 6, then find a : b : c.", "conf": 0.853, "box": [[327, 1126], [1107, 1119], [1108, 1159], [327, 1167]]}, {"text": "b) If d : e = 2 : 6 and e: f = 7: 8, then find d :e: f.", "conf": 0.843, "box": [[327, 1187], [1099, 1180], [1100, 1217], [327, 1224]]}, {"text": "c)If g : h = 8 : 9 and h :i = 9 : 12, then find g : h : i.", "conf": 0.879, "box": [[327, 1243], [1115, 1236], [1116, 1279], [327, 1286]]}, {"text": "d) ifj : k = 6 : 7 and k :I = 10 : 1, then findj: k : 1.", "conf": 0.874, "box": [[328, 1301], [1089, 1293], [1090, 1337], [328, 1346]]}, {"text": "e) If m : n = 2 : 8 and n :o = 5 : 6, then find m: n : 0.", "conf": 0.848, "box": [[328, 1358], [1143, 1348], [1144, 1395], [328, 1404]]}, {"text": "The measurement of three angies of a triangle are in the ratio 2 : 2 : 5.", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[328, 1437], [1494, 1429], [1495, 1472], [328, 1480]]}, {"text": "Find the measurement of each angle.", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[330, 1489], [953, 1482], [953, 1524], [330, 1531]]}, {"text": "The ratio of a to b is 8: 9 and b to c is 4 : 6. Find the continued ratio a : b : c.", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[328, 1569], [1591, 1559], [1592, 1608], [328, 1618]]}, {"text": "The two ratios of three quantities a, b and c are a : b = 2 : 3 and b : c = 4 : 5.", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[328, 1664], [1585, 1652], [1586, 1702], [328, 1714]]}, {"text": "Find their continued ratio.", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[335, 1723], [779, 1712], [780, 1749], [335, 1759]]}, {"text": "Divide Rs 7500 into the ratio 4 : 6 : 5.", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[334, 1927], [956, 1909], [958, 1949], [336, 1966]]}, {"text": "87", "conf": 0.663, "box": [[937, 2021], [982, 2021], [982, 2054], [937, 2054]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.867, "box": [[342, 2038], [631, 2024], [633, 2058], [344, 2072]]}]}